      "updated_at": "2022-11-23T20:32:50Z",
      "body": "~~(C5) setting f_lineno didn't evolve when the rest of the bytecodes evolved,\r\n  which means it is not safe any more::~~\r\n\r\n```py\r\n    import sys\r\n\r\n    def f():\r\n        try:\r\n            raise ValueError    # line 5\r\n        except ValueError:\r\n            print(42)           # line 7\r\n\r\n    def my_trace(*args):\r\n        print(args)\r\n        if args[1] == 'line':\r\n            f = args[0]\r\n            if f.f_lineno == 5:\r\n                f.f_lineno = 7\r\n        return my_trace\r\n\r\n    sys.settrace(my_trace)\r\n    f()\r\n    sys.settrace(None)\r\n```",
      "author_association": "MANNEQUIN",
      "pin": null,
